Experimental repository to provide glue for seamlessly integrating cargo build
with flutter plugins and packages.

See https://matejknopp.com/post/flutter_plugin_in_rust_with_no_prebuilt_binaries/
for a tutorial on how to use Cargokit.

Example plugin available at https://github.com/irondash/hello_rust_ffi_plugin.

## Vendored baseline

This copy tracks the Cargokit build tooling bundled with the
`flutter_rust_bridge_codegen` 2.13.0 integration template for the platforms
supported by `xelis_wallet_flutter`.

The 2.13 update imports Android 16 KB page alignment, current Flutter Gradle
plugin discovery, duplicate-target removal, and fully resolved Rustup
toolchains. The integration template's nested CI and OHOS-only code are not
vendored because they are outside this package's platform contract.

`run_build_tool.cmd` intentionally retains this repository's Dart discovery,
error checking, and exit-code propagation because those behaviors are more
robust than the 2.13 integration template.
